# Laptop-only actuator channel calibration. Never applied to hardware.
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 2
MNT1_TYPE 1
MNT1_PITCH_MIN -90
MNT1_PITCH_MAX 30
MNT1_DEFLT_MODE 2
SERVO9_FUNCTION 7
SERVO9_MIN 1000
SERVO9_MAX 2000
# The aircraft's rate (aerothon_hardware.parm) and winch_ctrl's fc_rate_max_mps:
# at 1.0 the simulated line ran 3.3x faster than the payout estimate, stow left
# 2.6 m out and the hook dragged through the return corridor (20 Oct 2026).
WINCH_TYPE 1
WINCH_RATE_MAX 0.30
SERVO10_FUNCTION 88
SERVO10_MIN 1000
SERVO10_MAX 2000
SERVO10_TRIM 1500
